# Four fixed products on rows 768–831

Each pair of integers packs 64 unchanged rows in lanes of width 896.
The kernel checks all six lane identifications and all four GF(4) products.
The soundness theorem recovers every literal streamed row equation.
Generated by `source/GenerateLanes.py`; source and measurements are in
`source/README.md`. No candidate-to-word interpretation is assumed.
-/

